Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.21,0:00:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-狼人  -它们的内脏都被掏出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Werewolf? - Their organs was ripped clean out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-心脏被吃掉  -这儿的人都是狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hearts consumed. - Everyone here's a wolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里不用"狼人"那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't use the "W" Word around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撕碎心脏  然后吃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break some hearts, then you eat 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-路西法  -该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucifer? - Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿着小卡的这身皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donning this...Cass mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们会救回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we'll get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会救回小卡  我们会杀了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna save Cass, we're gonna ice the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会干掉黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're gonna shank the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.43,0:00:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有人死  还有灵魂要收\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are still dying, souls to collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死那些死期到来的人  我有个名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill everyone whose number's up. I have a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无需恐惧死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death is nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想寻死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you got some kind of death wish or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你一直打算英勇就义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who's always wanted to go out blaze of glory style.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你怎么会死  -苔莎  帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are you dead? - Tessa, I need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法忍受你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't live with you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your time to go, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕拼了老命我也要救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if it's the last thing I do, I'm gonna save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我叫比莉  -死神比莉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Name's Billie. - The reaper Billie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟说你想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother says you want to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要确保等你们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna make sure that when you die...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会再活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you stay dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(48小时前)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.61,0:02:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.73,0:02:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I-I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  阿玛拉  路西法还是上帝之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? On Amara, Lucifer, Hand of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  是桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's a -- it's a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,貌似是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.18,0:02:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三个月以来有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, a pattern of missing campers --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五个驴友失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}five in the last three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走丢了呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巡林员本来也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what the rangers thought, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但几天前  他们发现了一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}until a couple days ago, when they found a body --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  心脏没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- minus a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在他们改说是动物袭击  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, they're calling it an animal attack, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们打电话  叫人去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we make a call and we put somebody on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.72,0:03:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把他救回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.69,0:03:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么救\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meantime, we got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,清空思绪  这是桩案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear our heads. I mean, this is a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去做本职工作  去办案吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do what we do. L-Let's work it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你还醒着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you still with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, they, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just hold tight, you two, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们得把子弹取出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen, we got to get that bullet out of there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会很疼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给  你可能用得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, might need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  就夹到了  就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Almost got it. Almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, there we go. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  我们留着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what? We got to keep that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,留个念想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one's gonna be a little memento.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改日拿来开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll laugh about it some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  她情况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? She ain't doing so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:20.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-给  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀的那个有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one he killed, he's got the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-What were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说他们是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you they were monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.61,0:04:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  亲爱的  你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, baby. You called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为狼人晚上才出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought werewolves needed nighttime,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,月圆之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}a full moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿待了几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们随时能变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys, they can change any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们可能是纯血的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's 'cause they were probably purebloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们能随时变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they can change any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随心所欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.39,0:04:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的手腕感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those wrists -- Those wrists are infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得处理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get something on them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:04:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.78,0:05:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing? How we doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  继续压住  压住\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep pressure on it. Keep pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包扎一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap those up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有固话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a landline in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a cellphone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几英里内都没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no service for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:21.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往回走几英里我车那里有信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a signal back at the car a couple miles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去找信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for a signal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后送你去见真正的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you to a real doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.69,0:05:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  在国家公园搭便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, hitching the national parks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最棒的蜜月了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best honeymoon ever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  我以为昨天...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? I thought yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是被划了几道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a couple scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.15,0:05:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不能留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, we can't stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人还在外面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with the others still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着  我弟弟中了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen, my brother's been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能一个人留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't stay here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam, hey. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你  搭着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help. Yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.09,0:05:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们走吧  走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guess we're going. Let's go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前很会记人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to be good with faces,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我年纪大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's my age
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:05.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来这儿的人又多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the number of folks that come through this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不像以前记得那么准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to have lost the knack, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现如今  40岁以下的人对我来说都一张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}These days, everybody under 40 looks the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道我们找对地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know we're in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.48,0:06:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在公园外的大地标都找过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've tried all the big landmarks outside of the park --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}the police station, the -- the --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们住的那家廉价旅馆  这间酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fleabag motel we're staying in, this bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我们要没人可问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we're running out of things to interrogate,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你想出去  开始审问树木\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you want to go outside, start talking to the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那今晚到这儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们早上可以去公园服务部\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we can go to Park Services in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找巡林员谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk to the rangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我想到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I was thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们该去地役权小屋看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys should check out one of the easement cabins.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是公园里的私产\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's private property within the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.80,0:06:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了避税才留着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just held onto for tax purposes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,驴友有时发现这些小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}so campers stumble on them
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能在里面待好几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they can hole up in there for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失踪的人里或许有住在那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of your missing could be in one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:05.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以告诉我们小屋都在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind, um, showing us about where they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这帮助很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有信号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太阳就要升起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sun's gonna be up pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就说不该在那间旅馆吃辣椒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that roadhouse chili was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.71,0:07:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  看看能不能找到无线电或电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, see if you can find a-a radio or a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.17,0:08:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿有火柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got matches over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把灯点上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna light those up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少是能走的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those of us who -- who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你说什么  -我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you say? - I -- Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米歇尔虽然状况不好  但她还有一丝希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Michelle's real sick, but she's got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他...在拖我们后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him -- he's slowing us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-如果他们发现我们  -我们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And if they find us -- - We saved you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们救了你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三条命换一条啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's three lives versus one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys need to -- to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.58,0:09:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去求救  再回来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find help, come back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  萨姆  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找点木头  给你搭个担架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find some wood, gonna build you a litter,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们把他抬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are going to carry him the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就几英里而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a couple of miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们把你们训练好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we trained you boys up right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.16,0:10:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我提醒你们他们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you they were coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.51,0:10:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就差没端在盘子里递上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all but served them up to you on a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿不能待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're burned here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收拾好他们的烂摊子  然后走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So clean up their mess and we'll get gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去找迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.95,0:11:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不肯丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有他  我们也不能活着走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we won't last out there without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.70,0:11:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.91,0:12:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  他突然就断气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't know. He just went.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.39,0:13:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.07,0:13:37.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.07,0:13:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你留下  跟他们打  你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay, you fight, you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so do we.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救救我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会回来找你的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna come back for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.77,0:14:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果我们往那边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, I think if we head in that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走四英里应该就能到小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be about a four-mile trek to the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直说要休息一下  去宿营\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we always talk about taking a break, going camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以把这当宿营  很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could be like camping. It could be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.19,0:15:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪里好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which part?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了条很弱的线索  在林子里冻得蛋疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freezing our nuts off in the middle of the woods on a thin lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  就是这部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're hurt bad and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.41,0:15:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love you, Michelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.76,0:15:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:57.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here, right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.99,0:16:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-天呐  -走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Geez. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是遇上什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you all get into?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她需要马上进行救治\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs medical attention right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  -不  你照顾好他们就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hold up. - No, no, just take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得回我车上  找我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get back to my car, back to my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  都给我冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, first, everyone is gonna settle down
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警官  我没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer, I don't have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我挤出时间来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.97,0:16:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(杨木急救中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽量别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to move if you can help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你断了几根肋骨  我还没来得及治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a couple broken ribs I haven't tended to yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:17:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那大概是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, and what is probably...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nasty concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.85,0:17:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do us both a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then his brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他弟弟死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}his brother just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些坏人  他们还在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guys, they're still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.97,0:17:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不知道他们是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what their deal was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只知道那人说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only what that guy told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"那人"  还有他弟弟救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That guy" saved us, and so did his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子经受了很大折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife's been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会给巡林员打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give a call to the rangers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他们去小屋和林站看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}have them check out the cabin and the station,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么发现我会通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'll let you know what they find.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米歇尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你妻子情况稳定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, your wife is stable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该给你看看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for me to get a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那得我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  真的  我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Really, I'm -- I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐在床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat on the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.62,0:19:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}...good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  查理  接电话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Charlie, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.07,0:19:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can -- Can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想来看看你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just wanted to see how you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to tell you th...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved our lives and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈以前常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my mom used to say, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那时并不相信  但现在我或许信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe her then, but I-I think I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她以前常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡不是结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}death -- it's not the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:20:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我  -你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I, uh... - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.13,0:21:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.26,0:21:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有话要跟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to a --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算不上是朋友  更像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wouldn't call it a friend, more like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一台恐怖疯狂的死亡机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}scary, crazy death machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人不是这世上唯一的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves aren't ‭the only monsters out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎么跟一台邪恶恐怖的死亡机器说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exactly do you talk to an evil, scary death machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果你不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想走  我理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to leave, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you want to help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找一切名字里带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for pretty much anything
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"巴比妥"(镇静安眠)的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}with "barbital" in the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这能成功吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.32,0:22:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吞药之后  去叫医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I do this, go get the doc
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell her to, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.99,0:22:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫她尽量把我救活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her to bring me back, if she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.35,0:23:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也别自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}no hard feelings, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不非得这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我必须做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.51,0:23:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.61,0:24:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去那边看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go around that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.85,0:24:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.05,0:24:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.07,0:25:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.46,0:25:35.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他服了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he take?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.61,0:25:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死  给我拿纳洛酮(吗啡拮抗药)来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Uh, grab me naloxone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.11,0:25:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个小瓶子  中间架上  还有一袋盐水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the little bottle, middle shelf, and a bag of saline.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.83,0:25:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得给他注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to run a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.31,0:25:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.78,0:25:56.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:25:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-按抓他  -我在使劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold him! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.79,0:27:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-帮帮忙  -老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Holy hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.78,0:27:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.19,0:27:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我放躺  那样更容易找血管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me on my back. ‭It's easier to find a vein.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.06,0:27:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  把他翻过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Roll him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.78,0:27:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我按住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.14,0:27:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可算来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.82,0:28:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么定格了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the freeze-frame?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.07,0:28:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在享受这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just savoring this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.90,0:28:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我得说  我想象过你很多死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I have to say of all the ways I thought you'd go --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.36,0:28:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,心脏病  被尖牙杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}heart attack, some fang,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.18,0:28:20.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连看《查理当家》时吃汉堡噎死\N{\fnArial\fs30}choking on a burger while binge-watching "Charles in Charge"...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是拜奥的经典\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was peak Baio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.05,0:28:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重点是  我没想到你是会自杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, never took you for the suicide type.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.91,0:28:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不符合你的殉道士精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't fit your whole martyr thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.24,0:28:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.44,0:28:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.19,0:28:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈萨姆的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.25,0:28:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.21,0:28:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.41,0:28:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-回来  -别耍把戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back? - Stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.57,0:28:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在你那儿  我需要他  我们做个交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you've got him, I need him. Let's make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,免了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.41,0:28:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.39,0:28:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.81,0:28:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the Darkness is out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.51,0:28:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界会毁灭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the world is gonna burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她得逞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once she gets started,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.75,0:28:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都将终结  包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the end of everything, including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.70,0:29:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆是唯一能阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Sam's the only one who can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.75,0:29:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.57,0:29:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.15,0:29:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过真有爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cute, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.43,0:29:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你假装想为大局救萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pretending you're trying to save Sam for the greater good,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.90,0:29:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们都知道  你不过是为了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we both know you're doing it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.89,0:29:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你受不了失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.05,0:29:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但即便萨姆能打赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if Sammy could win the title bout...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.07,0:29:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的答复还是"不"\N{\fnArial\fs30}the answer would still be "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.32,0:29:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远都是"不"\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer will always be "No."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.53,0:29:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game's over, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.08,0:29:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再没有第二次机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more second chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.95,0:29:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有多一条命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more extra lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.86,0:29:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该跟路易吉告别了  马里奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to say bye-bye to Luigi, Mario.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.88,0:29:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我恳求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.06,0:30:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让他回来  带我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him back and take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来跟你讨价还价的  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to bargain with you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是来收你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to reap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the kicker is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆还没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.79,0:30:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.78,0:30:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少很快就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or will be, soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.53,0:30:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脉搏在衰弱  把心搏托盘给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulse is fading. ‭Throw me that cardio tray.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.00,0:30:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么会  -相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But how? - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果温家人死了  我肯定会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the big "W" bit it, I'd get a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.36,0:30:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along now, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.21,0:30:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.09,0:30:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.73,0:30:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.11,0:30:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.97,0:30:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他翻过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn him on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.63,0:30:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.16,0:32:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He? - Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.30,0:32:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.12,0:32:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟他没啥关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.98,0:32:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a -- I need a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.25,0:32:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不  绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.93,0:32:40.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不是在求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, pal, I'm not asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.48,0:32:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  疯子  你盗窃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, psycho, I got you for stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.14,0:32:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并吞服剂量足以判重刑的限制药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and consuming a felony's worth of Schedule IV drugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.67,0:32:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还袭击警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus assaulting a police officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你哪都别想去  给他打镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't going nowhere. Sedate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.90,0:32:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.92,0:32:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们出去说句话  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we have a word outside, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.78,0:33:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在最不需要的就是再打药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More drugs is the last thing he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.70,0:33:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会再次没命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could die -- again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你盯住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, just keep your eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.03,0:33:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去呼叫白鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call over to White Bird,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫些支援来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get some backup in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.78,0:34:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:21.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.39,0:34:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.72,0:34:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.24,0:34:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在54号公路上的急救中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, at the Urgent Care on 54.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.71,0:34:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是柯...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Cor-- ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.85,0:34:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.62,0:34:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯宾跟你在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Corbin with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.42,0:34:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.62,0:34:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.80,0:35:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.09,0:35:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.45,0:36:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.84,0:36:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.50,0:36:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.43,0:36:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbin?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.21,0:36:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你  别怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't be scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.13,0:36:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.13,0:36:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, any of this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.40,0:36:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是发生了  我感觉好...\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's happened and it feels so...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.93,0:36:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.55,0:36:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.32,0:36:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.18,0:36:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-永远在一起  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forever. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.35,0:36:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.92,0:37:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.69,0:37:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可算来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.37,0:37:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.89,0:37:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.19,0:37:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,医生说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc says that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.34,0:37:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯宾憋死萨姆时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when Corbin choked him,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.09,0:38:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他进入了休克状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Sam's body went into shock
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.23,0:38:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的呼吸  心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his breathing, his heartbeat
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都减弱到几乎无法察觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}slowed down to almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.44,0:38:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他只是差点死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he was, uh -- ‭he was just mostly dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.01,0:38:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.25,0:38:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.57,0:38:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,柯宾不是个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corbin wasn't a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.51,0:38:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:41.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,米歇尔  这会很难承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, ‭this is gonna be very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.81,0:38:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.33,0:38:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.70,0:38:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}eventually ‭you'll get back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.74,0:38:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.01,0:39:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said I could leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.64,0:39:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就说我可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.33,0:39:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}where am I even supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起经历了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything we survived together...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.28,0:39:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是看着我爱的人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched the man I love die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.48,0:39:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也回不到正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no normal after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.61,0:39:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.30,0:39:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两夸脱O阴型血输进去  你就没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two quarts O-neg, and you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.28,0:39:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.82,0:39:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她很坚强  会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's strong. She'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.92,0:40:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,线缝得结实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those stitches gonna hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.32,0:40:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结实  是专业级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah -- uh, professional grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.56,0:40:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用几天抗生素  卧床休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple days of antibiotics and some bed rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.20,0:40:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就能恢复正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm, uh, back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.58,0:40:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我死了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you thought I was dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.99,0:40:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.49,0:40:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我考虑过重新装修你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought about redecorating your room,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.59,0:40:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放个按摩浴缸  迪斯科球\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, putting in a Jacuzzi, a nice disco ball --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.81,0:40:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提高地堡的格调\N{\fnArial\fs30}really class up the joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.98,0:40:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.89,0:40:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you weren't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.62,0:40:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.38,0:40:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.

